    <briefdescription>
<para>Structured exception for Index module errors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1index_1a638845e9cbf32fc1aeafcd3ec728fc40" kindref="member">IndexErrorCode</ref></computeroutput> with a human-readable message and an optional correlation ID (from <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1index_1_1_ann_query_context_1a9bd29a57f2bc22f92ac83847281acc19" kindref="member">AnnQueryContext::correlation_id</ref></computeroutput>).</para>
<para><bold>Design contract:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1index_1_1_index_error" kindref="compound">IndexError</ref></computeroutput> is thrown only for non-recoverable conditions that callers cannot handle via a <computeroutput>Result&lt;T&gt;</computeroutput> path.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>All public <ref refid="classthemis_1_1index_1_1_ann_frontdoor" kindref="compound">AnnFrontdoor</ref> methods prefer returning degraded results over throwing <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1index_1_1_index_error" kindref="compound">IndexError</ref></computeroutput>; exceptions indicate programming errors or unrecoverable backend failures. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
